# Yarus, Roar of the Old Gods returns a face-down creature that died only "if it's a permanent card" (CR 110.4a): Bot1 has
# Yarus, and Reality Shift exiles its own Memnite so it manifests the Lightning Bolt on top of its library (CR 701.40a). Bot2
# bolts the face-down 2/2; Yarus triggers for it, but the card it became is an instant, so it stays in Bot1's graveyard and
# nothing returns.

